# Keep the Docker build context small and reproducible.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/generated
**/src/generated

.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store

# Never ship real secrets into an image; env is injected at deploy time.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Docs and local artifacts are not needed at build time.
docs
tests
*.md
!README.md

services/media/uploads
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
